<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading Wednesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average fell 32.52 to 7928.32.</p>
<p>The NYSE Composite fell 2.34 to 478.43.</p>
<p>The average price per share was down $0.22.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 1463 to 1358.</p>
<p>Volume was 587,214,790 compared with 498,892,470 on Tuesday.</p>
